      "role": "user",
      "content": "therapists just try to fix things that might not be fixable. it's not like a broken arm you can just set. it's more like... if the engine is designed to fail, no amount of maintenance is gonna change the outcome. i look at my dad and my uncle and i just see what i'm gonna become. it feels less like a struggle and more like an inevitability.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
